<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Ramatex debuts at 7.00 rgt. [CORRECTED 2:31 GMT]</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Ramatex debuts at 7.00 rgt. [CORRECTED 2:31 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ramatex Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Tuesday at 7.00 ringgit, versus a 3.60 ringgit offer price.</p>
<p>(KLSE Corrects opening price from 5.20 ringgit).</p>
<p>The company, whose businesses include the making of yarn, knitting, printing and dyeing of fabrics and garments, offered 42.80 million shares.</p>
